  "headline": "RSPAD Submits Health Results For Candidates Sugiono And Andi Amran",
  "seoTitle": "RSPAD Submits Sugiono and Andi Amran Health Results",
  "metaDescription": "RSPAD Gatot Soebroto has delivered medical examination results for Sugiono and Andi Amran to the MPR, with a formal announcement expected on December 1.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The RSPAD Gatot Soebroto completed medical examinations for two vice presidential candidates, Andi Amran and Sugiono.",
    "The final medical assessment reports have been formally submitted to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR).",
    "The MPR is scheduled to disclose the official results of the health screenings during a plenary session on December 1, 2026."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian Army Central Hospital (RSPAD) Gatot Soebroto has concluded the medical evaluations for two candidates nominated for the position of vice president, Andi Amran and Sugiono. A team of 25 medical professionals conducted the screenings, which involved 14 distinct stages of assessment to ensure the candidates meet the health requirements for the 2024-2029 term. Following the completion of these tests, the hospital administration delivered the findings to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) for further review. The MPR verification team is tasked with processing these documents before a final announcement is made to the public during a plenary session set for December 1, 2026. This administrative process follows growing political discussion regarding potential candidates to fill the remaining term, ahead of a scheduled MPR Plenary Session on December 11.",
